+*   **Joint PDF:**
+    $$ p(\mathbf{b}, t_{dc} | \Xi) = \frac{G(\mathbf{a}, \mathbf{b}) G(\mathbf{b}, \mathbf{c})}{\pi^3 C_{t_{dc}}^{\max}} $$
+    The constant $C_{t_{dc}}^{\max}$ incorporates the product of the three isotropic phase functions $(4\pi)^{-3}$.
